<title>POLAND: Optimus surge continues to surprise.</title>
<headline>Optimus surge continues to surprise.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish computer maker Optimus SA rose 9.6 percent in heavy trade to 108.5 zlotys on Thursday after Wednesday's 10-percent-surge and traders said the stock might be experiencing a speculative rise.</p>
<p>&quot;The stock had been a little forgotten recently and didn't do well, but there's been no specific information that would justify such a sharp jump,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Thursday turnover was at 15.5 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
